    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d37">

                <pb facs="0026" n="20" sameAs="frus:frus1939v05/pg20"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.00111 A.R./31: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Panama</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Dawson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Panama</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1939-09-05T22:00:00-05:00">September 5,
                            1939—10 p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received September 6—12:10 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>95. The joint invitation was despatched by the Panamanian Government to the other
                    12 republics at 10:00 p.m. this evening.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Dawson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
